@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-004 — Accounts, authorization and recovery
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-019, UC-020, UC-021, UC-022, UC-023, UC-027, UC-028, UC-029

actor "Staff / Manager" as Person
actor "Authorized operator" as Op
participant UI
participant "Identity & Staff" as Identity
database "Identity DB" as DB
Person -> UI: Register / login / account action
UI -> Identity: Validated request
Identity -> DB: Check limits, account and current role
alt Register
 Identity -> DB: Pending account with bcrypt hash
 Identity --> UI: Pending approval
else Valid login
 Identity -> DB: Read active account + authVersion
 Identity --> UI: 2h JWT, tab memory only
else Manager account action
 Identity -> DB: Approve / lock / unlock with audit
else Invalid / rate limited / unavailable
 Identity --> UI: Generic error / 429 / 503
end
opt Staff recovery
 Person -> Identity: Manager issues code after verification
 Identity -> DB: Hash of one-use code, expiry
 Person -> Identity: Code + new password + confirmation
 Identity -> DB: Consume code, hash password, increment authVersion atomically
end
opt Manager bootstrap / recovery
 Op -> Identity: Local operator tool, verified target
 Identity -> DB: Bootstrap or recovery code + operator audit
 Identity --> Op: Outcome; no credential logged
end
note over Identity,DB
 Protected requests check present account state.
 Operator is an operating actor, not a new app RBAC role.
end note

@enduml
